    <title>aws/aws-sdk-net - Releases - 2025-10-10</title>
    <id>https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-net#2025-10-10</id>
    <link href="https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-net" />
    <updated>2025-10-11T00:06:21Z</updated>
    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-net/releases/tag/3.7.1142.0"&gt;3.7.1142.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h3&gt;3.7.1142.0 (2025-10-10 19:09 UTC)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BedrockAgentCore (3.7.504.0)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bedrock AgentCore release for Runtime, and Memory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BedrockAgentCoreControl (3.7.506.0)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bedrock AgentCore release for Gateway, and Memory including Self-Managed Strategies support for Memory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CloudFront (3.7.504.0)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added new viewer security policy, TLSv1.2_2025, for CloudFront.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Glue (3.7.508.0)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Addition of AuditContext in GetTable/GetTables Request&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lambda (3.7.501.0)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add InvokedViaFunctionUrl context key to limit invocations to only FURL invokes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Odb (3.7.501.0)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This release adds APIs that allow you to specify CIDR ranges in your ODB peering connection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RDS (3.7.506.5)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated the text in the Important section of the ModifyDBClusterParameterGroup page.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core 3.7.500.31
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updating endpoints.json file.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All services packages updated to require new Core&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-net/releases/tag/4.0.110.0"&gt;4.0.110.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h3&gt;4.0.110.0 (2025-10-10 19:05 UTC)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BedrockAgentCore (4.0.4.0)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bedrock AgentCore release for Runtime, and Memory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BedrockAgentCoreControl (4.0.6.0)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bedrock AgentCore release for Gateway, and Memory including Self-Managed Strategies support for Memory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CloudFront (4.0.6.0)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added new viewer security policy, TLSv1.2_2025, for CloudFront.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Glue (4.0.19.0)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Addition of AuditContext in GetTable/GetTables Request&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lambda (4.0.3.0)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add InvokedViaFunctionUrl context key to limit invocations to only FURL invokes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Odb (4.0.1.0)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This release adds APIs that allow you to specify CIDR ranges in your ODB peering connection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RDS (4.0.10.4)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated the text in the Important section of the ModifyDBClusterParameterGroup page.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensions.CborProtocol (4.0.0.8)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve performance of CBOR deserialization for large strings by preemptively expanding the buffer to fit the string.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core 4.0.1.0
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added ability to configure authentication scheme preferences (e.g., to prioritize SigV4a over SigV4 when both are supported): &lt;a href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdkref/latest/guide/feature-auth-scheme.html" rel="nofollow"&gt;https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdkref/latest/guide/feature-auth-scheme.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix issue &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3495246386" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-net/issues/4027" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/aws/aws-sdk-net/issues/4027/hovercard" href="https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-net/issues/4027"&gt;#4027&lt;/a&gt;. Pass in proxy settings when generating new token for SSO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All service and extension packages updated to require new Core&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
            </content>
  </entry>
